o></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Hotseat Multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 8 local players and compete for the perfect game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383820/extras/bf554636dc02a47d5ca51954ab63240e.poster.avif?t=1753724038\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383820/extras/bf554636dc02a47d5ca51954ab63240e.webm?t=1753724038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383820/extras/bf554636dc02a47d5ca51954ab63240e.mp4?t=1753724038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
